  "description": "A 2D blend space: X is the movement direction relative to where the character faces (-180 to 180 degrees, wrapping at the back), Y is speed. Only the walk and run clips exist, so strafing reuses them at the sides and the backwards case is the plain walk again. A real project would have strafe and backwards clips here."
